      "content": "Hey, I'm working on a new predictive model for our urban redevelopment portfolio. We're looking at several mid-sized cities that are going through rapid demographic shifts—basically areas seeing a lot of new immigrant populations moving into older residential zones. \n\nCan you help me outline a set of key risk indicators (KRIs) we should be tracking to assess \"community-level volatility\" in these specific types of transitioning neighborhoods? I need to know what variables might signal potential instability for long-term real estate investments.",
